    {
      "text": "Photograph of a crane lowering a white shipping container labelled \"Oxywise\", \"Hewatele\" and \"Medical oxygen generator\" with WHO logos onto a concrete base surrounded by a timber and pole frame, watched by people including staff in WHO vests.",
